				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a556b6d4-e5f4-4581-a960-21033e6f1676")
	)
	(text "J4: 1=+5 V, 2=GND.\nDisplay allocation <=1.2 A.\nDo not power through J3.\nLarger load needs separate\nregulated 5 V, common GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 337.82 198.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b1a4741e-dfe0-4ddf-b7ee-e8254d9a8474")
	)
	(text "R501..R513: all 33 ohms; values hidden here to keep close signal rows readable.\nAHCT accepts 3.3 V inputs; its 5 V outputs drive J3. Pull-downs default signals low; OE_N pull-up blanks at reset.\nStart with a short ribbon (<=30 cm); verify signal integrity. Pin8=GND here; some panels use address E.\nConfirm panel supply/pin mapping before connection or PCB layout."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 269.24 0)
